{"attempt_id": "attempt:um-opg-36887-sums-of-independent-random-variables-w-14d21875-source-fidelity-01", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:00:00Z", "graph_id": "graph:um-opg-36887-sums-of-independent-random-variables-w-14d21875-v1", "obligations": [{"acceptance": {"allowed_candidate_kinds": ["proof", "counterexample", "formalization", "computation"], "required_capabilities": ["human_review", "statement_faithfulness"]}, "dependencies": ["obligation:um-opg-36887-sums-of-independent-random-variables-w-14d21875-statement-fidelity"], "kind": "root_claim", "obligation_id": "obligation:um-opg-36887-sums-of-independent-random-variables-w-14d21875-root", "source_refs": ["https://www.unsolvedmath.com/problems/OPG-36887"], "statement": {"formal_declaration": null, "language": "en", "text": "Conjecture If $X_1, \\dotsc, X_n \\geq 0$ are independent random variables with $\\mathbb{E}[X_i] \\leq \\mu$, then $$\\mathrm{Pr} \\left( \\sum X_i - \\mathbb{E} \\left[ \\sum X_i \\right ] < \\delta \\mu \\right) \\geq \\min \\left ( (1 + \\delta)^{-1} \\delta, e^{-1} \\right).$$"}, "statement_sha256": "c9dff63f5f7fa2362a896685500e076dfcfab8eeac97f066cedc26adb0e65b32"}, {"acceptance": {"allowed_candidate_kinds": ["proof"], "required_capabilities": ["human_review", "statement_faithfulness"]}, "dependencies": [], "kind": "definition", "obligation_id": "obligation:um-opg-36887-sums-of-independent-random-variables-w-14d21875-statement-fidelity", "source_refs": ["https://www.unsolvedmath.com/problems/OPG-36887"], "statement": {"formal_declaration": null, "language": "en", "text": "Verify against the cited source that the frozen statement is complete, current, untruncated, attribution-correct, and unambiguous enough for mathematical research; record any definition or quantifier gap without silently editing the contract."}, "statement_sha256": "65f0b3d574bd6d837403149dab6434c0f571709f7eb5bb066c7e8774bad13f34"}], "problem_contract_sha256": "941bff9709ff8701813b564d5570d82e6f1f99ec8af18514dcc5a0a64663